text = "• Game Design & Development: Aiman, Usman and Aidil
• Engine: Godot Engine 4 (Mobile & Desktop)
• Visuals: Procedural Parallax Starfield & Dynamic Vectors
• Audio & FX: Built-in Procedural Waveform Synthesizer, freesound.org, pixabay
• Boss sound used: asianbeatz-riff-1.ogg by amby26 from freesound.org
• Boss sound 2 used: Candyworld Background Music by Sunsai from freesound.org
• Boss sound 3 used: Boss battle Loop #3 by Sirkoto51 from freesound.org
• Laser SFX used: Microwave by earthsounds from freesound.org
• Pair Programming Assistant: Google Antigravity AI
•Also not forgotten, YOU(The Player)!
"
